+/*
+ * One frame: WM (vfe_wm_start/update, frame based as cam_vfe_bus_ver3_config_rdi_wm for MIPI RAW10), CSID
+ * top/RDI0/RX (csid_configure_stream), RUP + AUP (reg_update_rdi: bit 4 + n and 20 + n), RDI resume, then the
+ * source. Waits for BUF_DONE (RDI0) up to timeout_ms; then halts RDI0 and the WM.
+ */
